-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Aenean eu leo quam. Pellentesque ornare sem lacinia quam venenatis vestibulum. Fusce dapibus, tellus ac cursus commodo, tortor mauris condimentum nibh.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:29:12','2025-10-02 10:29:12','f54994ab-20e1-4935-b91c-c634e90966a0'),(58,58,1,NULL,'__temp_vjcqenztenwqdnbjeaoufajpbezaedwnfdaw',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Datastar Blog\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:258@1:url}\"}, \"e07011df-84b0-4504-8c98-7af8c534248c\": [2527], \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Filter posts by category and load more results with server-rendered Twig and Datastar.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:30:41','2026-11-13 15:53:18','6c46ce7d-b515-4a34-bfb2-da550c53fe9a'),(61,61,1,NULL,'__temp_vjcqenztenwqdnbjeaoufajpbezaedwnfdaw',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Purus Ligula Vehicula Tortor\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:14@1:url}\"}, \"e07011df-84b0-4504-8c98-7af8c534248c\": [41], \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue. Vestibulum id ligula porta felis euismod semper.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:30:41','2025-10-02 10:30:41','643b838a-588c-45f0-81cc-ceac723d9088'),(65,65,1,NULL,'__temp_lxpgaomhbryfxiauurlxexhrqgqbctjrinec',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Datastar Map\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"value\": \"{entry:1029@1:url}\"}, \"e07011df-84b0-4504-8c98-7af8c534248c\": [2526], \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Explore a location listing connected to a Leaflet map, with filters, markers and clustering.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:32:20','2026-11-13 15:53:18','989a58b7-3e9c-4512-9733-87df42340445'),(68,68,1,NULL,'__temp_lxpgaomhbryfxiauurlxexhrqgqbctjrinec',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Mollis Vehicula Sem Consectetur\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:14@1:url}\"}, \"e07011df-84b0-4504-8c98-7af8c534248c\": [41], \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Integer posuere erat a ante venenatis dapibus <strong>posuere</strong> velit aliquet. Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:32:20','2025-10-02 10:32:20','44f8ef6e-1298-4ab3-b872-d1032a8f3545'),(74,74,1,NULL,'__temp_lczjuokmzbhhbyxyrynxewsouacztdqeogei',NULL,NULL,1,'2025-10-02 10:45:23','2025-10-02 10:45:23','cc9c1a42-92a3-4377-ae60-40a15dc2f1ae'),(75,75,1,NULL,'__temp_qrcmkinkbbxnuibhhyluprgddxbrnwukdrjd',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>A Matrix field holds a sequence of entries with different types. Here, those types represent page blocks. Editors choose a block, fill in its fields and move it into place. Twig renders each entry through its block template.</p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"How does the Matrix Builder work?\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:45:23','2026-11-13 14:13:19','d89bff07-47b4-40d4-be0e-c230df977d4c'),(76,76,1,NULL,'__temp_fdmnmwnhizyqaowchspafavppvztbhftromn',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>Use a text block for headings, paragraphs, lists and links. This introduction is a text block. Rich text stays editable in Craft while its presentation comes from the shared typography styles.</p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"Text\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:45:23','2026-11-13 14:13:19','6c007b98-b370-42f6-b7c2-d9c1415549fa'),(79,79,1,NULL,'__temp_qrcmkinkbbxnuibhhyluprgddxbrnwukdrjd',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>Curabitur blandit tempus porttitor. Donec sed odio dui. Donec ullamcorper nulla non metus auctor fringilla. Vivamus sagittis lacus vel augue laoreet rutrum faucibus dolor auctor. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec id elit non mi porta gravida at eget metus.</p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"Elit Porta Ipsum Cursus Pharetra\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:45:23','2025-10-02 10:45:23','f0c746c6-e1f6-40cd-b0b1-68d3a3b76653'),(80,80,1,NULL,'__temp_fdmnmwnhizyqaowchspafavppvztbhftromn',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et. Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue. Curabitur blandit tempus porttitor. Maecenas faucibus mollis interdum. Aenean eu leo quam. Pellentesque ornare sem lacinia quam venenatis vestibulum.</p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"Egestas Magna Tortor Condimentum Dolor\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:45:23','2025-10-02 10:45:23','748cfd53-4433-4e2b-9b03-42ed50216fbe'),(84,84,1,NULL,'__temp_sqhkxwtlwqdgpomsyqfjgdeialsntxttdqnm',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>A media block displays an image, video or audio asset, with an optional caption. The image example below uses responsive image transforms and includes a photographer credit.</p><p><a href=\\\"#block-media\\\">View the media block</a></p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"Media\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:46:53','2026-11-13 14:13:19','03787edf-0c82-4415-85e0-ae010a99e1f7'),(87,87,1,NULL,'__temp_sqhkxwtlwqdgpomsyqfjgdeialsntxttdqnm',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>Morbi leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros. Donec id elit non mi porta gravida at eget metus. Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur et. Morbi leo risus, porta ac consectetur ac, vestibulum at eros. Cras mattis consectetur purus sit amet fermentum. Cum sociis natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur ridiculus mus. Donec ullamcorper nulla non metus auctor fringilla.</p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"Cras Pellentesque Ligula Condimentum Tristique\"}',1,'2025-10-02 10:46:53','2025-10-02 10:46:53','bacfdec2-cebf-48e0-928f-95c14f1c420c'),(90,90,1,NULL,'__temp_ssedhvejnbomhxziekbsplayakexpmtvvapn',NULL,'{\"1d7830ee-7479-40b2-96b0-17200bd14633\": \"Build your own page.\", \"4f0be684-f690-4928-92e0-e614fd7efe16\": \"<p>Start with the example blocks, adapt their fields and templates, and give them your own design. The starter kit and demo templates are available on GitHub.</p>\", \"8731b252-877d-4cfa-80b2-c380c4af26be\": {\"type\": \"url\", \"label\": \"👉 Download Craft Kit\", \"value\": \"https://github.com/handplant/craftcms-lazy-starter-kit\"}}',1,'2025-10-02 10:48:03','2026-11-13 14:13:20','86da9b50-0bd3-4193-bc1f-1b37e987180f'),(99,99,1,'Builder','builder','builder','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Builder\"}',1,'2025-10-02 11:04:52','2026-11-13 15:13:09','80b83982-8e85-4e6a-8cdc-3be6db712358'),(102,102,1,'CKE Builder','cke-builder',NULL,'{\"5e2baca9-5c68-4147-b9e7-0df1a3d033d9\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"value\": \"{entry:99@1:url}\"}}',1,'2025-10-02 11:07:43','2025-10-02 11:07:43','df7afbbc-8a98-4174-af09-a70049216b04'),(197,197,1,'Richtext','richtext','richtext','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"981facbf-3e2f-4e4b-9f37-d1b8629dd72b\": \"<h1><strong>Why Use Richtext in a Starter Kit?</strong></h1><p>While Matrix fields offer ultimate flexibility, richtext blocks are great for speed and simplicity. This Craft CMS Starter Kit uses a hybrid approach: use <a href=\\\"{entry:99@1:url||https://craft-kit.dev/cke-builder}\\\">Richtext</a> where it’s enough, and <a href=\\\"{entry:12@1:url||https://craft-kit.dev/matrix-builder}\\\">Matrix</a> where you need layout control.</p><blockquote><p>Richtext writes fast. Matrix builds anything. This kit gives you both.</p></blockquote><h2><strong>Advantages of Richtext:</strong></h2><ol><li>Great authoring experience</li><li>Fast rendering</li><li>Clean HTML output</li><li>Ideal for blog posts, legal pages, or intro texts</li></ol><h2><strong>Semantic HTML for Better SEO</strong></h2><p>All heading levels (`&lt;h1&gt;` to `&lt;h4&gt;`) are preserved and styled via Tailwind CSS. This helps search engines better understand the page structure – which improves your SEO without extra effort.</p><p><strong>Here’s a list just for fun:</strong></p><ul><li>Fast setup with Craft CMS 5</li><li>Built-in CKEditor 5 integration</li><li>Datastar-powered frontend</li><li>Tailwind + Vite + GraphQL</li><li>Developer-friendly and production-ready</li></ul><h2><strong>Customizing the Richtext Experience</strong></h2><p>You can define custom styles, toolbars, and plugins directly in the CKEditor config. Want to add buttons, callouts, or emojis? No problem. This starter kit gives you a clean base to extend the editing experience however you like. 🚀</p><p><strong>Want more control inside your editor?</strong> Check out the <a href=\\\"{entry:99@1:url||https://craft-kit.dev/cke-builder}\\\">CKEditor Builde</a>r – a powerful way to insert design-consistent components directly into rich text, combining WYSIWYG comfort with structured content.</p><pre><code class=\\\"language-plaintext\\\">{\\n\\t\\\"editor\\\": \\\"CKEditor 5\\\",\\n\\t\\\"approach\\\": \\\"hybrid\\\",\\n\\t\\\"richtext\\\": \\\"for content\\\",\\n\\t\\\"matrix\\\": \\\"for layout\\\",\\n\\t\\\"result\\\": \\\"best of both worlds\\\"\\n}</code></pre>\"}',1,'2025-10-02 11:50:26','2026-03-17 05:57:55','552bc7fd-48c4-44e2-93f6-b39562dd8f52'),(214,214,1,NULL,'__temp_iuqtjsmrlgyfgamoicbmshrwnihaozshbzmr',NULL,NULL,1,'2025-10-02 12:03:53','2025-10-02 12:03:53','3daf410f-9e60-4cce-8653-df433212dd4e'),(215,215,1,NULL,'__temp_dxtimhpfruderepiywupiwbzaabmxgnqgevz',NULL,'{\"2dba2ca7-6750-4abe-9d92-ec4e65d8329e\": true, \"35eccd8c-7a80-4452-8dfb-029ade24766e\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"