ling.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:04:49','2025-10-07 10:04:49','cc5d1903-548d-4e26-97fc-9cf8d49c8447'),(446,446,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"🧱 Matrix Builder\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:05:31','2025-10-07 10:05:31','4cd9015a-8004-477d-bca0-1180a734e3c1'),(447,447,1,NULL,'__temp_igexmbvajwvcuuzsdrygzfnvhrvrckpdgpyk',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">A visual playground for Craft CMS Matrix fields — showcasing flexible, component-based content blocks with consistent markup and styling.</p><p>Nullam quis risus eget urna mollis ornare vel eu leo. Vestibulum id ligula porta felis euismod semper. Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue. Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue. Aenean eu leo quam. Pellentesque ornare sem lacinia quam venenatis vestibulum.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:05:31','2025-10-07 10:05:31','a5d4df21-909d-4cb3-97db-95982cb69e14'),(450,450,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"🧱 Matrix Builder\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:10:26','2025-10-07 10:10:26','63296120-3391-4f93-8d6f-d4c64177af7d'),(451,451,1,NULL,'__temp_igexmbvajwvcuuzsdrygzfnvhrvrckpdgpyk',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">The <strong>Matrix Builder</strong> is a visual demonstration of how Craft CMS handles flexible, component-based content through Matrix fields.</p><p>It shows how editors can create rich page layouts by combining different “blocks” — such as text, images, quotes, buttons, or call-to-action elements — without writing any code. Each block is represented by a reusable Twig component with a consistent markup and design system, making it easy for developers to maintain, extend, and customize. For newcomers to Craft CMS, this page provides a clear example of how to structure and render Matrix content dynamically, keeping full control over HTML output and styling.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:10:26','2025-10-07 10:10:26','cd06b542-a332-4a8e-8908-04e43f37cf1c'),(454,454,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"🧱 Matrix Builder\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:12:30','2025-10-07 10:12:30','64fb3f16-34a0-404a-9cbd-59509ad37dc0'),(455,455,1,NULL,'__temp_igexmbvajwvcuuzsdrygzfnvhrvrckpdgpyk',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">The <strong>Matrix Builder</strong> is a visual demonstration of how Craft CMS handles flexible, component-based content through Matrix fields.</p><p>It shows how editors can create rich page layouts by combining different “blocks” — such as text, images, quotes, buttons, or call-to-action elements — without writing any code. Each block is powered by a reusable Twig component with consistent markup and a shared design system, making it easy for developers to maintain, extend, and customize.</p><p>What makes this setup especially powerful is that <strong>every component can be placed anywhere within the custom CSS Grid layout</strong>, using named grid areas like content, popout, feature, or full. This gives editors complete control over structure and visual hierarchy while developers retain full semantic and performance control.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:12:30','2025-10-07 10:12:30','4eadfd44-9bc4-4c12-bf03-04d1bbd44f20'),(458,458,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"🧱 Matrix Builder\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:13:19','2025-10-07 10:13:19','3ea5b863-d62d-4e46-8066-7454090d8163'),(459,459,1,NULL,'__temp_igexmbvajwvcuuzsdrygzfnvhrvrckpdgpyk',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">The <strong>Matrix Builder</strong> is a visual demonstration of how Craft CMS handles flexible, component-based content through Matrix fields.</p><p>It shows how editors can create rich page layouts by combining different “blocks” — such as text, images, quotes, buttons, or call-to-action elements — without writing any code. Each block is powered by a reusable Twig component with consistent markup and a shared design system, making it easy for developers to maintain, extend, and customize.</p><p>What makes this setup especially powerful is that <strong>every component can be placed anywhere within the custom </strong><a href=\\\"/layout\\\"><strong>CSS Grid layout</strong></a>, using named grid areas like content, popout, feature, or full. This gives editors complete control over structure and visual hierarchy while developers retain full semantic and performance control.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:13:19','2025-10-07 10:13:19','08247197-c226-487f-8713-9ff04076d10f'),(465,465,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"🧱 Matrix Builder\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:16:37','2025-10-07 10:16:37','4e154538-45d8-4786-8aa7-4d2bdd0735b8'),(466,466,1,NULL,'__temp_ggcamffnpfxkkqkyiogvkbusxetubwjpugiu',NULL,'{\"0f59f188-6699-4347-a393-7cc6ddd680fc\": false}',1,'2025-10-07 10:16:37','2025-10-07 10:16:37','d254c265-68ae-4a91-bae8-2305ed0fe080'),(467,467,1,NULL,'__temp_vlktkftqsphxfjyndyemvdqeyyhcodychxau',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Dapibus Nullam Egestas Consectetur\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:258@1:url}\"}, \"e07011df-84b0-4504-8c98-7af8c534248c\": [28], \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Aenean eu leo quam. Pellentesque ornare sem lacinia quam venenatis vestibulum. Fusce dapibus, tellus ac cursus commodo, tortor mauris condimentum nibh.</p>\"}',1,'2025-10-07 10:16:37','2025-10-07 10:16:37','6c56a26a-28ce-40fd-8fc5-43584fd560f5'),(468,468,1,NULL,'__temp_vjcqenztenwqdnbjeaoufajpbezaedwnfdaw',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Purus Ligula Vehicula Tortor\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:197@1:u