93-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Interactive Maps in Craft CMS — Datastar & Leaflet Demo\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Dynamic markers, category filters, and clustering — powered by Craft CMS, Leaflet, and Datastar. A hypermedia-driven map built entirely in Twig, with the server as the single source of truth\", \"fb364fbf-e22b-4dbe-8570-724df7c5e068\": []}',1,'2025-11-07 12:34:18','2026-04-20 15:16:10','2607c8ac-d324-49bd-b8de-7128fa9b66dc'),(1087,1087,1,'Map','datastar-map','map','{\"2b51574c-5057-4c70-9a63-3e3612eb11b0\": \"<h1><strong>🧭 Datastar + Leaflet Demo</strong></h1><p>The <strong>Datastar-powered Map</strong> shows how you can build <strong>interactive, data-driven maps</strong> in <strong>Craft CMS</strong> — without relying on any JavaScript framework. Using <strong>Datastar</strong>, the map dynamically updates <strong>markers, filters, and clusters</strong> based on live CMS data — all rendered directly in <strong>Twig</strong>.</p><p>⚡ <strong>Reactive without React</strong></p><p>Every interaction — like filtering by category or selecting an item from the list — triggers a lightweight Datastar patch request that updates only what’s needed. No reloads, no heavy frontend stack — just instant feedback.</p><h3>🗺️ <strong>Powered by Leaflet.js</strong></h3><p>Leaflet handles map rendering while Datastar manages reactivity. The result is a setup that stays <strong>fast, accessible, and fully server-rendered</strong>.</p><h3>🎯 <strong>Perfect for:</strong></h3><p>directories • location listings • event maps • or any project using dynamic geodata — all without leaving the comfort of Craft + Twig.</p><p>✨ <i>In short: a modern, dynamic map experience — built purely with Craft CMS, Leaflet, and Datastar.</i></p>\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:34:56','2025-11-07 12:34:56','ddbfe2f5-b812-44ea-8d1a-dab5451c41bc'),(1088,1088,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Interactive Maps in Craft CMS with Datastar & Leaflet\", \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"A live demo of an interactive Leaflet map powered by Craft CMS and Datastar. Dynamic markers, filters, and clustering — all from real CMS data.\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:34:56','2025-11-07 12:34:56','6a036e8b-3121-43a2-b45a-fd61643a16b2'),(1090,1090,1,'Euismod Magna Etiam Vulputate','euismod-magna-etiam-vulputate','blog/euismod-magna-etiam-vulputate','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-05-20 22:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [260], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 11, \"lat\": 37.9755648, \"lng\": 23.7348324, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Athens\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Attica, Attica\", \"county\": \"Regional Unit of Central Athens\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Greece\", \"postcode\": \"105 57\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Athens, Municipality of Athens, Regional Unit of Central Athens, Attica, 105 57, Greece\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"Euismod Magna Etiam Vulputate\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:35:34','2025-11-07 12:35:34','aa28af89-195c-46a9-aad5-9b18ecc4a9b6'),(1095,1095,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"CraftCMS Lazy —\\nA simple Craft CMS Starter Kit\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:36:41','2025-11-07 12:36:41','b52a7365-7b86-4f5f-8589-19b66decd0f9'),(1096,1096,1,NULL,'__temp_xkxefblkbqrrpgdsmxpjqahpwwtxucyulfla',NULL,'{\"0f59f188-6699-4347-a393-7cc6ddd680fc\": false}',1,'2025-11-07 12:36:41','2025-11-07 12:36:41','b99d2354-43fb-4d17-8778-33590962dec5'),(1097,1097,1,NULL,'__temp_wivzvacapfdmeujajaupvewukwdvqvhisguk',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \