oup\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Hesse\", \"county\": \"\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Germany\", \"postcode\": \"\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Frankfurt, Hesse, Germany\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": 1107, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"d74fbbee-f4c8-448b-b8fc-d5723a6d0f07\": 0, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"⚡ Bitcoin: The Open Protocol for Value\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:48:15','2026-11-13 15:41:27','33baff51-2bf8-4fe4-a465-6fe952d9801b'),(1108,1108,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"41d42c36-230e-4e28-96f8-8a4801e9694e\": \"<p>Bitcoin is an open protocol for transferring value. Explore the idea of shared rules and a decentralized network, then try the Datastar-powered price demo.</p>\", \"914ae46d-5dd7-4afd-b5a3-32fbed3aecae\": [2685]}',1,'2025-11-07 12:48:15','2026-11-13 15:45:52','267c3248-d6fd-4ad7-a356-6328f2693b79'),(1109,1109,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Bitcoin — The Open Protocol for Value\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Bitcoin is an open protocol for transferring value. Explore the idea of shared rules and a decentralized network, then try the Datastar-powered price demo.\", \"fb364fbf-e22b-4dbe-8570-724df7c5e068\": [2685]}',1,'2025-11-07 12:48:15','2026-11-13 15:53:18','b671ed22-b835-455b-88ba-f74bc19f4528'),(1110,1110,1,NULL,'__temp_xywfexnhyxzniuroeiuvyfhpbiwlqqqfblwo',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">Bitcoin is an open protocol for transferring value. What interests me is the architecture: public rules, independently operated nodes and a network that does not depend on one application\'s database.</p><h2>Shared rules, independently checked</h2><p>Participants can run software that verifies transactions and blocks against the protocol\'s rules. Control is distributed across a network rather than assigned to a single bank or platform.</p><p>The current consensus rules limit issuance to approximately 21 million bitcoin. Those rules are maintained through software and network agreement, not an administrator changing a balance in a central system.</p><h2>Security has costs and limits</h2><p>Proof of work consumes energy to make rewriting transaction history expensive. That does not remove every risk: wallets can be compromised, services can fail and transactions require care. Confirmation times and fees also vary.</p><p>Bitcoin is neither an instant-payment guarantee nor a promise of financial returns. This article is a technical introduction, not investment advice.</p><h2>Why there is a Bitcoin panel in Craft Kit</h2><p>The small Bitcoin button in this site\'s navigation is also a Datastar example. Open it and Craft fetches the BTC/USDT ticker from Binance on the server, renders the result in Twig and sends an HTML update to the browser.</p><p>While the panel is open, Datastar runs the refresh countdown and requests an update roughly every ten seconds. When it is closed, the interval does not request ticker updates. The open state, countdown and request indicator all use Datastar signals and attributes.</p><p>The visitor\'s browser talks to this website, not directly to Binance. Market data is illustrative and may be delayed or unavailable; it is not an execution price.</p><h2>The useful takeaway</h2><p>A live data panel does not need a separate frontend application. The same server-rendered pattern powers the <a href=\\\"{entry:258@1:url||https://craftcms-lazy.ddev.site/blog}\\\">blog filters</a>, <a href=\\\"{entry:723@1:url||https://craftcms-lazy.ddev.site/search}\\\">search</a> and <a href=\\\"/hypermedia-todolist-craft-cms-datastar\\\">Todo List</a>.</p><p><a href=\\\"https://github.com/handplant/craftcms-lazy-starter-kit\\\">Explore the Craft Kit source on GitHub</a> to see the Datastar attributes and Twig endpoints behind the panel.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:49:49','2026-11-13 15:50:56','a9995a35-e563-46f8-9fdd-0bf08677c6a5'),(1111,1111,1,'Michael fortsch AA5sf7 W Tv10 unsplash',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2025-11-07 12:52:41','2025-11-07 12:52:41','7a430b78-5f4a-4f28-9d7d-e42f8ce7c349'),(1112,1112,1,'Bitcoin: The Open Protocol for Value','bitcoin-the-open-protocol-for-value','blog/bitcoin-the-open-protocol-for-value','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-06 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [876], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 13, \"lat\": 50.1106444, \"lng\": 8.6820917, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Frankfurt\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Hesse\", \"county\": \"\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Germany\", \"postcode\": \"\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Frankfurt, Hesse, Germany\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"⚡ Bitcoin: The Open Protocol for Value\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:53:44','2025-11-07 12:53:44','5f21f556-3462-4e8d-8b00-413b0cba3a61'),(1113,1113,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"41d42c36-230e-4e28-96f8-8a4801e9694e\": \"<p>Bitcoin isn’t just “crypto.” It’s an open protocol for transferring value — global, secure, and unstoppable. A system built on code, not trust.</p>\", \"914ae46d-5dd7-4afd-b5a3-32fbed3aecae\": [1111]}',1,'2025-11-07 12:53:44','2025-11-07 12:53:44','a39c5160-3369-45b0-a23c-83ada44a00f2'),(1114,1114,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Bitcoin — The Open Protocol for Value\", \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Bitcoin is more than digital money — it’s an open, decentralized protocol for transferring value without banks or borders. Built on math, code, and freedom.\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:53:44','2025-11-07 12:53:44','4465619b-a92c-4b53-b776-3ca1f546cf35'),(1115,1115,1,NULL,'__temp_xywfexnhyxzniuroeiuvyfhpbiwlqqqfblwo',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">Bitcoin is no longer just a speculative asset — it’s an <strong>open, decentralized protocol</strong>, much like the Internet itself. Except instead of moving data, it moves <strong>value</strong> — instantly, globally, and without permission.</p><h2><strong>🧠 Why It Matters</strong></h2><p>Today’s financial system runs on trust in institutions. Bitcoin replaces that trust with <strong>math and code</strong>. The rules are transparent, and no one can change them — not banks, not governments, not developers.</p><p><strong>21 million Bitcoin.</strong></p><p>No more, no less. Ever.</p><h2><strong>🔋 Energy, Security &amp; Misconceptions</strong></h2><p>Yes — Bitcoin uses energy.</p><p>But that energy <strong>secures the network</strong>, making it the most resilient computing system on the planet. It has been running for over <strong>15 years without interruption</strong> — no hacks, no bailouts, no downtime.</p><h2><strong>🧩 The Real Innovation</strong></h2><p>Bitcoin isn’t “crypto.” It’s the opposite. It’s simple, minimal, and stable by design. No founders, no marketing department — just open-source code and a global network of users keeping it alive.</p><p>It’s a <strong>protocol</strong>, not a product.</p><h2><strong>🏁 Final Thought</strong></h2><p>Whether you see it as a store of value, digital cash, or an idea — Bitcoin is about <strong>freedom, transparency, and self-sovereignty</strong>.</p><p>It’s not about getting rich. It’s about <strong>getting free</strong>.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:53:44','2025-11-07 12:53:44','0945eeb2-86cd-4071-829d-50e1cc6f63b0'),(1116,1116,1,'Bitcoin: The Open Protocol for Value','bitcoin-the-open-protocol-for-value','blog/bitcoin-the-open-protocol-for-value','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-06 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [876], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 13, \"lat\": 50.1106444, \"lng\": 8.6820917, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Frankfurt\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Hesse\", \"county\": \"\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Germany\", \"postcode\": \"\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Frankfurt, Hesse, Germany\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"⚡ Bitcoin: The Open Protocol for Value\"}',1,'2025-11-07 12:53:47','2025-11-07 12:53:47','8584ae7c-9f85-4471-a623-cf28373e1532'),(1117,1117,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"CraftCMS Lazy —\\nA simple Craft CMS Starter Kit\"}',1,'2025-11-10 07:58:08','2025-11-10 07:58:08','7c16d98b-d9af-43e8-8d35-24c04dfd6365'),(1118,1118,1,NULL,'__temp_xmyryjgfvmihfecdlkmvkhurafqliwjajpcz',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">A modern, production-ready Craft CMS Starter Kit with Vite, Tailwind, Vue Web Components, Datastar, GraphQL and DDEV — perfect for agencies and freelancers who want to build clean and fast Craft sites..</p><p>This starter kit helps developers quickly spin up clean and maintainable Craft CMS projects. It includes ready-made examples for Matrix Blocks, CKEditor integration, a Datastar-powered Search page, and both Datastar- and Vue-based blog listings.</p><p><strong>🧠 Built with modern tools and clean architecture</strong></p><ul><li>⚙️ <strong>Craft CMS 5</strong> – latest version with flexible content modeling</li><li>⚡ <strong>Vite</strong> – fast bundling and instant reloads</li><li>🧩 <strong>DDEV</strong> – reproducible local development environment</li><li>🚀 <strong>Datastar</strong> – lightweight, reactive frontend for dynamic UIs</li><li>🗺️ <strong>Leaflet</strong> – interactive, data-driven maps with clustering and live filtering</li><li>🧱 <strong>Vue 3 (Web Components)</strong> – progressive enhancement with custom elements</li><li>🔗 <strong>GraphQL</strong> – structured data fetching directly from Craft</li><li>🎨 <strong>Tailwind CSS v4</strong> – utility-first styling with CSS variables</li><li>🎞️ <strong>Anime.js</strong> – smooth element animations and scroll-based transitions</li><li>🗃️ <strong>Craft eagerly() + render()</strong> – optimized queries, automatic block templates, and smart caching</li><li><strong>🧾 SEO-Ready JSON-LD Organization Schema </strong>– structured data for Google Rich Results</li><li>🔍 <strong>SEO Meta, Open Graph &amp; Sitemap </strong>– powered by SEOMate for share-friendly pages</li><li>🔌 <strong>Plugins:</strong> CKEditor, Datastar, Map, Image Resizer, SEOMate, Vite</li></ul><p>💻 Feel free to explore, fork, or contribute — this starter kit is open source and available on <a href=\\\"https://github.com/handplant/craftcms-lazy-starter-kit\\\">GitHub</a>.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-10 07:58:08','2025-11-10 07:58:08','624bd202-6fa8-4ee0-a340-31e8426980a3'),(1119,1119,1,'Craft CMS – Built for teams that care about quality','craft-cms-built-for-teams-that-care-about-quality','blog/craft-cms-built-for-teams-that-care-about-quality','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-09 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [876], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": null, \"lat\": 40.416782, \"lng\": -3.703507, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Madrid\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Community of Madrid\", \"county\": \"\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Spain\", \"postcode\": \"\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Madrid, Community of Madrid, Spain\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": 1119, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"d74fbbee-f4c8-448b-b8fc-d5723a6d0f07\": 0, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"Craft CMS —\\nBuilt for teams that care about quality\"}',1,'2025-11-10 11:20:26','2026-11-13 15:41:27','6a40098c-0691-4a37-ae89-5017d544eff4'),(1120,1120,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"41d42c36-230e-4e28-96f8-8a4801e9694e\": \"<p>A clear content model, maintainable Twig and reactive UI with Datastar. See how Craft Kit brings editors, designers and developers onto a shared foundation.</p>\", \"914ae46d-5dd7-4afd-b5a3-32fbed3aecae\": [2686]}',1,'2025-11-10 11:20:26','2026-11-13 15:45:52','26f74ecf-c936-4746-bbae-3c7c648938e8'),(1121,1121,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Craft CMS – The modern CMS for creative teams and serious developers\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"A clear content model, maintainable Twig and reactive UI with Datastar. See how Craft Kit brings editors, designers and developers onto a shared foundation.\", \"fb364fbf-e22b-4dbe-8570-724df7c5e068\": [2686]}',1,'2025-11-10 11:20:26','2026-11-13 15:53:18','7da10de8-d122-43d7-8599-6bf033c1014c'),(1122,1122,1,NULL,'__temp_whefxcmmzovbxnoomtjpsrynwzlivarixbef',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">A good content platform should give editors a clear workflow, designers control over the result and developers a codebase they can still understand after handoff. That is why I build with Craft CMS, Twig and Datastar.</p><h2>Start with the content</h2><p>Craft lets you model the actual work: pages, articles, locations and reusable components, with fields and relationships that match the project. Editors see the inputs they need, rather than a generic page builder with every option switched on.</p><p>In Craft Kit, Matrix composes page sections and CKEditor handles text with embedded components. Both use the same Twig component templates. Explore the <a href=\\\"{entry:99@1:url||https://craftcms-lazy.ddev.site/builder}\\\">Builder demo</a> to see the distinction.</p><h2>Keep the interface close to the templates</h2><p>Datastar adds reactivity without replacing Craft\'s rendering model. Twig still produces the markup. A filter change requests new results; an update returns HTML; signals keep the browser\'s transient state coordinated.</p><p>This is not reserved for the headline demos. Navigation dropdowns, the mobile menu and the search panel use Datastar too. There is no Alpine, React or Vue layer for everyday interface state.</p><h2>A shared foundation for the team</h2><ul><li><strong>Editors</strong> work with structured, reusable content rather than raw layout instructions.</li><li><strong>Designers</strong> get custom markup and styling instead of a theme\'s constraints.</li><li><strong>Developers</strong> can follow a feature from its HTML attributes to the Twig endpoint that renders the response.</li></ul><p>Craft Kit includes Tailwind and Vite for styling and asset builds. Specialist libraries handle the map, slider and gallery; Datastar owns the ordinary reactive UI. The stack is deliberate, not dependency-free.</p><h2>Quality is implemented, not automatic</h2><p>Accessibility, sensible query limits, eager loading, cache boundaries and server-side validation still need to be built. A smaller rendering architecture makes those decisions easier to see; it does not make them disappear.</p><h2>Try it before choosing it</h2><p>Use the <a href=\\\"{entry:258@1:url||https://craftcms-lazy.ddev.site/blog}\\\">blog filters</a>, <a href=\\\"{entry:1029@1:url||https://craftcms-lazy.ddev.site/map}\\\">interactive map</a>, <a href=\\\"{entry:723@1:url||https://craftcms-lazy.ddev.site/search}\\\">search</a> and <a href=\\\"/hypermedia-todolist-craft-cms-datastar\\\">Todo List</a>. Then look at how the templates implement them.</p><p><a href=\\\"https://github.com/handplant/craftcms-lazy-starter-kit\\\">Download Craft Kit on GitHub</a>. It is a starter kit for your own Craft and Datastar work, not a finished client website or a mandatory design system.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-10 11:23:54','2026-11-13 15:50:56','eeb4789b-d21a-48e1-996f-68b0df238c52'),(1123,1123,1,'Firmbee com gcs N Os PE Xfs unsplash',NULL,NULL,'{\"48d2238f-4200-4601-8702-9f2157892222\": \"Firmbee.com / Unsplash\", \"e30c17b9-ffa5-4343-99ee-0f780e5e0ed0\": \"Planning an interface on paper.\"}',1,'2025-11-10 11:58:24','2026-11-13 14:12:14','7aec2a96-8baf-43d1-82c6-de416aebec3d'),(1124,1124,1,'Craft CMS – Built for teams that care about quality','craft-cms-built-for-teams-that-care-about-quality','blog/craft-cms-built-for-teams-that-care-about-quality','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-09 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [876], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 14, \"lat\": 40.416782, \"lng\": -3.703507, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Madrid\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Community of Madrid\", \"county\": \"\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Spain\", \"postcode\": \"\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Madrid, Community of Madrid, Spain\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"Craft CMS —\\nBuilt for teams that care about quality\"}',1,'2025-11-10 12:00:00','2025-11-10 12:00:00','d9eb0ee2-fbf9-49e5-a00e-e5b70c202fb1'),(1125,1125,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"41d42c36-230e-4e28-96f8-8a4801e9694e\": \"<p>Craft CMS gives creative teams full control — no limits, no plugin chaos, no compromise.</p>\", \"914ae46d-5dd7-4afd-b5a3-32fbed3aecae\": [1123]}',1,'2025-11-10 12:00:00','2025-11-10 12:00:00','c9519ba0-f0e0-479d-9010-54af9338455b'),(1126,1126,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Craft CMS – The modern CMS for creative teams and serious developers\", \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Craft CMS gives creative teams the freedom to build without limits. Designed for marketers, developers, and brands that value performance, design, and control.\"}',1,'2025-11-10 12:00:00','2025-11-10 12:00:00','d93d560f-b232-48c3-88d9-fd1983952a0b'),(1127,1127,1,NULL,'__temp_whefxcmmzovbxnoomtjpsrynwzlivarixbef',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">Behind every great website is a tool that empowers, not restricts.</p><p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">Craft CMS is built for creators who take their work seriously — developers who love clean, flexible code, designers who value creative freedom, and marketing teams who need speed and control.</p><p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">It’s not just a CMS — it’s the foundation for digital experiences that last.</p><h2>🚀 Why Craft CMS stands out</h2><p><strong>Craft CMS isn’t another theme-based builder.</strong></p><p>It’s a professional content platform that puts flexibility and creative control first — so your team can build faster, scale smarter, and design without compromise.</p><ul><li>✨ Modern, secure, and future-proof</li><li>⚙️ Custom structures instead of rigid templates</li><li>🧩 Clean architecture and Twig templating</li><li>🌍 Multilingual and SEO-ready</li><li>💻 Built for both editors and developers</li></ul><p>Craft gives your team a reliable foundation to create websites, portals, and web apps that perform — and age gracefully.</p><h2>💼 For marketing &amp; content teams</h2><p>Craft CMS is made for marketers who want freedom without friction. The authoring experience is clean, intuitive, and perfectly suited for fast-moving campaigns.</p><ul><li>🖋️ Create and update content in seconds</li><li>🧱 Build landing pages using flexible content blocks</li><li>🌍 Manage multilingual campaigns with ease</li><li>🔄 Clear approval workflows and role management</li><li>📈 Optimize SEO and analytics without external tools</li></ul><p>No cluttered dashboards, no technical barriers — just a CMS that lets you move at the speed of ideas.</p><h2>💻 For developers &amp; agencies</h2><p>Developers love Craft because it’s built with them in mind. It’s logical, modular, and plays nicely with modern frameworks and workflows.</p><ul><li>🧠 Clean, modern codebase (PHP, Twig, Yii2 → Laravel from v6)</li><li>🔗 REST &amp; GraphQL APIs for headless or hybrid setups</li><li>⚡ Datastar for reactive UIs without heavy JavaScript frameworks</li><li>🧩 Extendable through plugins, modules &amp; CLI tools</li><li>🧱 Works seamlessly with Tailwind, Vue, Alpine.js &amp; Vite</li><li>🔒 Fully versionable, CI/CD-ready, and docker-compatible</li></ul><p>With <strong>Craft + DataStar + Laravel</strong>, developers get the best of both worlds — a powerful CMS engine combined with a robust PHP framework and a modern, reactive front-end layer.</p><p>From small brand sites to complex web platforms, Craft delivers flexibility, speed, and long-term maintainability.</p><h2>🎨 For designers &amp; creatives</h2><p>Design without compromise. Craft gives designers full freedom to translate creative concepts directly into functional, responsive layouts.</p><ul><li>🎨 No theme limitations</li><li>🧭 Full control over markup &amp; components</li><li>📱 Responsive, accessible, and pixel-perfect</li><li>💡 Ideal for design systems and modular layouts</li></ul><p>It’s design-first, without the chaos.</p><h2>🌍 A growing community</h2><p>Craft CMS is continuously improved, open-code, and supported by a vibrant global community. More than 50,000 websites worldwide rely on it — from independent studios to established brands.</p><p>It’s the platform behind digital craftsmanship: reliable, flexible, and built to last.</p><h2>🧩 Summary</h2><blockquote><p>Craft CMS isn’t a shortcut.<br />It’s a tool for people who build things the right way — with purpose, precision, and pride.</p></blockquote><p>Clean, fast, flexible — and designed for teams that care about what they create.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-10 12:00:00','2025-11-10 12:00:00','6232cc30-e860-4f09-ad3d-017681987379'),(1128,1128,1,'Craft CMS – Built for teams that care about quality','craft-cms-built-for-teams-that-care-about-quality','blog/craft-cms-built-for-teams-that-care-about-quality','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-09 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [876], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 14, \"lat\": 40.416782, \"lng\": -3.703507, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Madrid\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Community of Madrid\", \"county\": \"\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Spain\", \"postcode\": \"\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Madrid, Community of Madrid, Spain\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"Craft CMS —\\nBuilt for teams that care about quality\"}',1,'2025-11-10 12:00:02','2025-11-10 12:00:02','c6251ea7-3c5d-4bec-98ae-a43067fcd349'),(1131,1131,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"🧱 Matrix Builder\"}',1,'2025-11-12 13:41:00','2025-11-12 13:41:00','4ca15b49-f961-4f5a-9ec4-ba33e14689bc'),(1132,1132,1,NULL,'__temp_igexmbvajwvcuuzsdrygzfnvhrvrckpdgpyk',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">The <strong>Matrix Builder</strong> is a visual demonstration of how Craft CMS handles flexible, component-based content through Matrix fields.</p><p>It shows how editors can create rich page layouts by combining different “blocks” — such as text, images, quotes, buttons, or call-to-action elements — without writing any code. Each block is powered by a reusable Twig component with consistent markup and a shared design system, making it easy for developers to maintain, extend, and customize.</p><p>What makes this setup especially powerful is that <strong>every component can be placed anywhere within the custom </strong><a href=\\\"/layout\\\"><strong>CSS Grid layout</strong></a>, using named grid areas like content, popout, feature, or full. This gives editors complete control over structure and visual hierarchy while developers retain full semantic and performance control.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-12 13:41:00','2025-11-12 13:41:00','cf4584dc-f46a-4f8c-9fa4-71152d9e2ee9'),(1135,1135,1,'Community','community',NULL,'{\"a8247aa8-49d4-46eb-9425-55d63c4de5ca\": \"#e57171\"}',1,'2025-11-13 09:53:53','2026-11-13 15:20:51','e376724c-5e75-4487-99e7-6af62446224b'),(1136,1136,1,'Community','community',NULL,'{\"a8247aa8-49d4-46eb-9425-55d63c4de5ca\": \"#ee2b2b\"}',1,'2025-11-13 09:54:05','2025-11-13 09:54:05','66683349-40d3-4193-985d-3db812c576f5'),(1138,1138,1,'Why I Still Choose Craft CMS — Block 81','why-i-still-choose-craft-cms-block-81','blog/why-i-still-choose-craft-cms-block-81','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-12 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [1135], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 15, \"lat\": 45.5202471, \"lng\": -122.674194, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Portland\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Oregon\", \"county\": \"Multnomah County\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"United States\", \"postcode\": \"\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Portland, Multnomah County, Oregon, United States\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"96a98d05-9c97-4424-b5b3-b60a09dafe54\": {\"type\": \"url\", \"value\": \"https://block81.com/blog/why-i-still-choose-craft-cms\"}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"Why I Still Choose Craft CMS — Block 81\"}',1,'2025-11-13 09:56:25','2025-11-13 09:56:25','6c95e697-c93a-4c08-b013-3f3e490ba1da'),(1139,1139,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"41d42c36-230e-4e28-96f8-8a4801e9694e\": \"<p>A seasoned digital agency explains why Craft CMS continues to outperform other systems — from flexible content modeling to a clean authoring experience and powerful built-in tools. A quick, convincing read for anyone choosing their next CMS.</p>\", \"914ae46d-5dd7-4afd-b5a3-32fbed3aecae\": [42]}',1,'2025-11-13 09:56:25','2025-11-13 09:56:25','861befdb-638a-4fb7-b755-ab34ea1e3d73'),(1140,1140,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Why I Still Choose Craft CMS — Block 81\", \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"A seasoned digital agency explains why Craft CMS continues to outperform other systems — from flexible content modeling to a clean authoring experience and powerful built-in tools. A quick, convincing read for anyone choosing their next CMS.\"}',1,'2025-11-13 09:56:25','2025-11-13 09:56:25','4a70457a-8648-4eae-8ebb-793ae2f08bd0'),(1144,1144,1,'Craft CMS 6: A Forward-Looking Deep Dive by ContentReactor','craft-cms-6-a-forward-looking-deep-dive-by-contentreactor','blog/craft-cms-6-a-forward-looking-deep-dive-by-contentreactor','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-12 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [1135], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 16, \"lat\": 48.2083537, \"lng\": 16.3725042, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Vienna\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"\", \"county\": \"\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Austria\", \"postcode\": \"\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Vienna, Austria\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"96a98d05-9c97-4424-b5b3-b60a09dafe54\": {\"type\": \"url\", \"value\": \"https://contentreactor.com/en/insights/craft-6\"}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"Craft CMS 6: A Forward-Looking Deep Dive by ContentReactor\"}',1,'2025-11-13 10:32:13','2025-11-13 10:32:13','a156dedc-c671-43c9-bf83-3dc571ceb6cf'),(1145,1145,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"41d42c36-230e-4e28-96f8-8a4801e9694e\": \"<p>The team at ContentReactor explores what Craft CMS 6 brings to the table — from improved multisite workflows to enhanced authoring tools — and why it’s shaping up to be a major milestone for modern content platforms.</p>\", \"914ae46d-5dd7-4afd-b5a3-32fbed3aecae\": [43]}',1,'2025-11-13 10:32:13','2025-11-13 10:32:13','f448b58c-dfe4-4987-9fa0-1afa8166b214'),(1146,1146,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Craft CMS 6: A Forward-Looking Deep Dive by ContentReactor\", \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"The team at ContentReactor explores what Craft CMS 6 brings to the table — from improved multisite workflows to enhanced authoring tools — and why it’s shaping up to be a major milestone for modern content platforms.\"}',1,'2025-11-13 10:32:13','2025-11-13 10:32:13','9685b5e7-9a2d-4f41-8107-7890b2d94494'),(1148,1148,1,'Craft CMS 6: A Forward-Looking Deep Dive by ContentReactor','craft-cms-6-a-forward-looking-deep-dive-by-contentreactor','blog/craft-cms-6-a-forward-looking-deep-dive-by-contentreactor','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-12 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [1135], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 17, \"lat\": 48.1988955, \"lng\": 16.3497251, \"zoom\": 15, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Vienna\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"\", \"county\": \"\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"Neubaugasse, KG Neubau, Neubau\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Austria\", \"postcode\": \"1070\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"Neubaugasse, KG Neubau, Neubau, Vienna, 1070, Austria\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"96a98d05-9c97-4424-b5b3-b60a09dafe54\": {\"type\": \"url\", \"value\": \"https://contentreactor.com/en/insights/craft-6\"}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"Craft CMS 6: A Forward-Looking Deep Dive by ContentReactor\"}',1,'2025-11-13 10:33:12','2025-11-13 10:33:12','a1b2dbed-91b2-46ff-af54-4ce0b811b7b2'),(1152,1152,1,'How Craft CMS Helps Businesses Scale Their Content Operations by Appfoster','how-craft-cms-helps-businesses-scale-their-content-operations-by-appfoster','blog/how-craft-cms-helps-businesses-scale-their-content-operations-by-appfoster','{\"6268711e-041f-4ba2-ac1f-69075f35f133\": {\"date\": \"2025-11-12 23:00:00\"}, \"6ebd48e4-16ae-438b-88db-b7c32dac5dbd\": [1135], \"7f45d57a-6089-4476-9875-732dfa47a1a0\": {\"id\": 12, \"lat\": 43.8349486, \"lng\": -79.5074666, \"zoom\": 9, \"parts\": {\"arm\": \"Orion Arm\", \"city\": \"Vaughan\", \"group\": \"the Local Group\", \"state\": \"Golden Horseshoe, Ontario\", \"county\": \"York Region\", \"galaxy\": \"Milky Way\", \"number\": \"9131\", \"planet\": \"Earth\", \"system\": \"the Solar System\", \"address\": \"Keele Street\", \"cluster\": \"Virgo Cluster\", \"country\": \"Canada\", \"postcode\": \"L4K 5B4\", \"supercluster\": \"Laniakea Supercluster\"}, \"address\": \"9131, Keele Street, Vaughan, York Region, Golden Horseshoe, Ontario, L4K 5B4, Canada\", \"fieldId\": 35, \"ownerId\": null, \"distance\": null, \"what3words\": null, \"ownerSiteId\": 1}, \"96a98d05-9c97-4424-b5b3-b60a09dafe54\": {\"type\": \"url\", \"value\": \"https://appfoster.com/web-development/how-craft-cms-help-businesses-scale-their-content-operations\"}, \"f333c3f6-b95e-4720-8b85-bac84b0fd6bf\": \"How Craft CMS Helps Businesses Scale Their Content Operations by Appfoster\"}',1,'2025-11-13 10:37:09','2025-11-13 10:37:09','39b66f9c-d269-449d-9856-1cbf8488f225'),(1153,1153,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"41d42c36-230e-4e28-96f8-8a4801e9694e\": \"<p>Appfoster presents a compelling case for how Craft CMS enables organizations to grow their content workflows efficiently — leveraging structured content models, powerful integrations and intuitive authoring experiences to support enterprise-scale operations.</p>\", \"914ae46d-5dd7-4afd-b5a3-32fbed3aecae\": [43]}',1,'2025-11-13 10:37:09','2025-11-13 10:37:09','20f18f71-5287-4339-9dce-7d995d6a92f2'),(1154,1154,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"How Craft CMS Helps Businesses Scale Their Content Operations by Appfoster\", \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Appfoster presents a compelling case for how Craft CMS enables organizations to grow their content workflows efficiently — leveraging structured content models, powerful integrations and intuitive authoring experiences to support enterprise-scale operations.\"}',1,'2025-11-13 10:37:09','2025-11-13 10:37:09','61abe6f6-9fa1-422b-9135-ee20071d2212'),(1157,1157,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"CraftCMS Lazy —\\nA simple Craft CMS Starter Kit\"}',1,'2025-11-18 10:07:28','2025-11-18 10:07:28','2ffc28d7-fa3e-42ae-b927-173e728928ca'),(1158,1158,1,NULL,'__temp_xmyryjgfvmihfecdlkmvkhurafqliwjajpcz',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">A modern, production-ready Craft CMS Starter Kit with Vite, Tailwind, Vue Web Components, Datastar, GraphQL and DDEV — perfect for agencies and freelancers who want to build clean and fast Craft sites..</p><p>This starter kit helps developers quickly spin up clean and maintainable Craft CMS projects. It includes ready-made examples for Matrix Blocks, CKEditor integration, a Datastar-powered Search page, and both Datastar- and Vue-based blog listings.</p><p><strong>🧠 Built with modern tools and clean architecture</strong></p><ul><li>⚙️ <strong>Craft CMS 5</strong> – latest version with flexible content modeling</li><li>⚡ <strong>Vite</strong> – fast bundling and instant reloads</li><li>🧩 <strong>DDEV</strong> – reproducible local development environment</li><li>🚀 <strong>Datastar</strong> – lightweight, reactive frontend for dynamic UIs</li><li>🗺️ <strong>Leaflet</strong> – interactive, data-driven maps with clustering and live filtering</li><li>🧱 <strong>Vue 3 (Web Components)</strong> – progressive enhancement with custom elements</li><li>🔗 <strong>GraphQL</strong> – structured data fetching directly from Craft</li><li>🎨 <strong>Tailwind CSS v4</strong> – utility-first styling with CSS variables</li><li>🎞️ <strong>Anime.js</strong> – smooth element animations and scroll-based transitions</li><li>🛞 <strong>Embla Carousel</strong> – ultra-smooth, touch-friendly sliders with full customization</li><li>🗃️ <strong>Craft eagerly() + render()</strong> – optimized queries, automatic block templates, and smart caching</li><li><strong>🧾 SEO-Ready JSON-LD Organization Schema </strong>– structured data for Google Rich Results</li><li>🔍 <strong>SEO Meta, Open Graph &amp; Sitemap </strong>– powered by SEOMate for share-friendly pages</li><li>🔌 <strong>Plugins:</strong> CKEditor, Datastar, Map, Image Resizer, SEOMate, Vite</li></ul><p>💻 Feel free to explore, fork, or contribute — this starter kit is open source and available on <a href=\\\"https://github.com/handplant/craftcms-lazy-starter-kit\\\">GitHub</a>.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-18 10:07:28','2025-11-18 10:07:28','2f47c507-1617-4cae-9326-353c46114d5a'),(1168,1168,1,NULL,'__temp_awiesparhzqylaqztqrjxfevvsldtjdnyvjr',NULL,NULL,1,'2025-11-18 10:15:37','2025-11-18 10:15:37','4ad8fa3d-1f3d-4052-93f2-33d0537d0f58'),(1169,1169,1,NULL,'__temp_iwehllemswxtjrechvbuvprnzpooxrcjktcd',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"CKEditor Builder\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:99@1:url}\"}, \"e07011df-84b0-4504-8c98-7af8c534248c\": [], \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Combine editable rich text and reusable components in one field.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-18 10:15:37','2026-11-13 14:13:20','0728efe5-3f72-4df1-b2b8-047a73e03561'),(1170,1170,1,NULL,'__temp_eotiwlzzapgiwvhsiznjjmbidgcqrwhvozbg',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Datastar Search\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:723@1:url}\"}, \"e07011df-84b0-4504-8c98-7af8c534248c\": [], \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Search Craft content and update the results as you type.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-18 10:15:37','2026-11-13 14:13:20','e4b2213b-d96c-43bd-8289-6c598c2c54ed'),(1171,1171,1,NULL,'__temp_ylemifpwvuyctlwdehmbulafpegthmaqheca',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Datastar Blog\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:258@1:url}\"}, \"e07011df-84b0-4504-8c98-7af8c534248c\": [], \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Try category filtering and load-more pagination without a full page reload.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-18 10:15:37','2026-11-13 14:13:20','8f625f7f-407e-4cf7-af43-5c37938ff0bc'),(1172,1172,1,NULL,'__temp_ehhrklzrainhieblfenjrffadyetuiiwpiaw',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Datastar Map\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{e