aintainable base for new client projects.</li><li><strong>Freelancers</strong> use it to skip boilerplate and jump straight into building features.</li></ul><p>If you want a modern Craft CMS foundation that follows best practices out of the box, this starter kit gives you exactly that — without getting in your way.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:36:42','2025-11-20 13:36:42','10c07f58-bb06-41f5-989a-0fabf3827354'),(1308,1308,1,NULL,'__temp_ohiusfogvisouscmvaffpjgvgzgwfvdtjkli',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p><strong>🧠 Built with modern tools and clean architecture</strong></p><ul><li>⚙️ <strong>Craft CMS 5</strong> – latest version with flexible content modeling</li><li>⚡ <strong>Vite</strong> – fast bundling and instant reloads</li><li>🧩 <strong>DDEV</strong> – reproducible local development environment</li><li>🚀 <strong>Datastar</strong> – lightweight, reactive frontend for dynamic UIs</li><li>🗺️ <strong>Leaflet</strong> – interactive, data-driven maps with clustering and live filtering</li><li>🧱 <strong>Vue 3 (Web Components)</strong> – progressive enhancement with custom elements</li><li>🔗 <strong>GraphQL</strong> – structured data fetching directly from Craft</li><li>🎨 <strong>Tailwind CSS v4</strong> – utility-first styling with CSS variables</li><li>🎞️ <strong>Anime.js</strong> – smooth element animations and scroll-based transitions</li><li>🛞 <strong>Embla Carousel</strong> – ultra-smooth, touch-friendly sliders with full customization</li><li>🗃️ <strong>Craft eagerly() + render()</strong> – optimized queries, automatic block templates, and smart caching</li><li><strong>🧾 SEO-Ready JSON-LD Organization Schema </strong>– structured data for Google Rich Results</li><li>🔍 <strong>SEO Meta, Open Graph &amp; Sitemap </strong>– powered by SEOMate for share-friendly pages</li><li>🔌 <strong>Plugins:</strong> CKEditor, Datastar, Map, Image Resizer, SEOMate, Vite</li></ul><p>💻 Feel free to explore, fork, or contribute — this starter kit is open source and available on <a href=\\\"https://github.com/handplant/craftcms-lazy-starter-kit\\\">GitHub</a>.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:36:42','2025-11-20 13:36:42','de5b8ab1-999a-4a53-9688-6251d8101a05'),(1309,1309,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Craft Kit —\\nCraft CMS Starter Kit – Fast, Modern & Production-Ready\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:36:44','2025-11-20 13:36:44','4ebb30c0-30b0-4ca4-a799-c466777e5179'),(1313,1313,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Craft Kit —\\nCraft CMS Starter Kit – Fast, Modern & Production-Ready\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:38:30','2025-11-20 13:38:30','a4a8e109-fa62-4e04-b997-c64b413f9f2c'),(1314,1314,1,NULL,'__temp_xkxefblkbqrrpgdsmxpjqahpwwtxucyulfla',NULL,'{\"0f59f188-6699-4347-a393-7cc6ddd680fc\": false}',1,'2025-11-20 13:38:30','2025-11-20 13:38:30','cf9f06ac-8f57-42e1-ae67-e3625cedb2db'),(1315,1315,1,NULL,'__temp_rookcbakctclekveurvtcgllabmfytnayywb',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"✍️ CKEditor Builder\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:99@1:url}\"}, \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Keeps editors fast and consistent — add structured components into CKEditor with one click.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:38:30','2025-11-20 13:38:30','c00eb33c-74f1-4b68-8783-1cda41f75da8'),(1323,1323,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Craft Kit —\\nCraft CMS Starter Kit – Fast, Modern & Production-Ready\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:39:46','2025-11-20 13:39:46','9ddfb37a-20b8-4e2f-8218-e5d40858274a'),(1324,1324,1,NULL,'__temp_xkxefblkbqrrpgdsmxpjqahpwwtxucyulfla',NULL,'{\"0f59f188-6699-4347-a393-7cc6ddd680fc\": false}',1,'2025-11-20 13:39:46','2025-11-20 13:39:46','b3bb49d4-9a9c-45fa-a78e-b9f555340b53'),(1325,1325,1,NULL,'__temp_ymqpcozflkswyiztejqhscgrwkbbvylnvwoy',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"🧱 Matrix Builder\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:12@1:url}\"}, \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Create flexible page layouts with a clean, modular Matrix structure. Perfect for editor-friendly, scalable content.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:39:46','2025-11-20 13:39:46','38161b15-1367-42a8-b597-c5be8aa2e293'),(1326,1326,1,NULL,'__temp_exydctshdtrxmqnzznfpmdmwtnijllasnzlm',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"⚡ Datastar Search\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:723@1:url}\"}, \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Lightning-fast live search powered by Datastar. Instant results, reactive UI, and minimal JavaScript — fully Twig-first.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:39:46','2025-11-20 13:39:46','08959be4-1749-4650-9b1e-375a71c2ffeb'),(1327,1327,1,NULL,'__temp_wivzvacapfdmeujajaupvewukwdvqvhisguk',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"🚀 Datastar Blog\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:258@1:url}\"}, \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>A modern blog setup with live filtering, pagination, and instant updates — no page reloads, no heavy frameworks.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:39:46','2025-11-20 13:39:46','47bfa71b-f45a-469e-9779-ece0931417ee'),(1328,1328,1,NULL,'__temp_lwnertfphvvauwgyrfvklnfsixfpapkltjzf',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"🗺️ Datastar Map\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:1029@1:url}\"}, \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Interactive maps with dynamic markers, category filters, and clustering. All rendered directly in Twig with Datastar.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:39:46','2025-11-20 13:39:46','514ad6bb-02bb-46e5-837e-8e1db67217f9'),(1329,1329,1,NULL,'__temp_uvnzbtbsulagvvlmhwivhpmohuohwpnvjcon',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"🧭 Grid Layout\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"url\", \"label\": \"Layout\", \"value\": \"/layout\"}, \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>A simple, responsive grid system used across all pages. Define full, content, feature, and popout layouts with ease.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:39:46','2025-11-20 13:39:46','0e182dd2-ae86-4f36-8ceb-30467d465ddb'),(1332,1332,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Craft Kit —\\nCraft CMS Starter Kit – Fast, Modern & Production-Ready\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:41:14','2025-11-20 13:41:14','b9046480-02eb-43b2-bc60-f9463f45826d'),(1333,1333,1,NULL,'__temp_qidilehdbzvpsmfjihkjiogbgamgjxlbldmq',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p><strong>About this project</strong></p><p>This starter kit reflects how I structure and build modern Craft CMS projects: clean, modular, and ready for real-world production use. I’m <strong>Andi Grether</strong>, a freelance Craft CMS specialist working with creative agencies and design teams who need a reliable technical partner for high-quality implementation.</p><p>If you’re interested in working together or want support on your next Craft project, feel free to reach out via <a href=\\\"https://webworker.me\\\"><strong>webworker.me</strong></a>.</p>\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:41:14','2025-11-20 13:41:14','8d7ebf69-03e0-47dc-a3b3-9dfafae96b89'),(1336,1336,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"🧱 Matrix Builder\"}',1,'2025-11-20 13:45:52','2025-11-20 13:45:52','924ab3e1-3d35-48d2-a691-68748da65d96'),(1337,1337,1,NULL,'__temp_ssedhvejnbomhxziekbsplayakexpmtvvapn',NULL,'{\"1d7830ee-7479-40b2-96b0-17200bd14633\": \"Use these components in your own project!\", \"2f0f4a25-fdf8-4cf1-a7c5-6591cf58478a\": true, \"60975007-2c9c-4def-920c-c569249360dc\": [43], \"8731b252-877d-4cfa-80b2-c380c4af26be\": {\"type\": \"url\", \"label\": \"👉 Download Craft Kit\", \"value\": \