k, and easy to maintain across your whole team.</p>\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"Hypermedia Blog — Datastar Filtering & Pagination in Craft CMS — Category filtering, load-more pagination, and instant updates — built with Datastar and Craft CMS. Hypermedia-driven, Twig-first, zero JavaScript framework.\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:09:40','2026-04-20 15:09:40','b8e55a28-520c-48aa-b444-5af142d92d66'),(2188,2188,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Matrix Builder\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"Matrix Builder — Component-Based Page Layouts in Craft CMS — Flexible page layouts with Craft CMS Matrix fields — reusable Twig components, custom CSS Grid, and full editorial control. No code required for editors.\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:11:37','2026-04-20 15:11:37','b02052ad-266a-4160-9011-273b2ca333e7'),(2189,2189,1,NULL,'__temp_igexmbvajwvcuuzsdrygzfnvhrvrckpdgpyk',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p>Flexible, component-based page layouts — editors combine blocks like text, images, CTAs and quotes without touching code. Every block is a reusable Twig component, placed into a custom CSS Grid with named areas like content, popout, or full. Editors\\n  control structure. Developers control markup.</p>\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:11:37','2026-04-20 15:11:37','62c56d86-c91c-4fac-b980-92b4be3f8bb2'),(2190,2190,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Matrix Builder — Component-Based Page Layouts in Craft CMS\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Flexible page layouts with Craft CMS Matrix fields — reusable Twig components, custom CSS Grid, and full editorial control. No code required for editors.\", \"fb364fbf-e22b-4dbe-8570-724df7c5e068\": [470]}',1,'2026-04-20 15:11:37','2026-04-20 15:11:37','6ee6ae82-db44-4069-98f3-6158ab7b2d61'),(2194,2194,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Matrix Builder\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"Matrix Builder — Component-Based Page Layouts in Craft CMS — Flexible page layouts with Craft CMS Matrix fields — reusable Twig components, custom CSS Grid, and full editorial control. No code required for editors.\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:12:20','2026-04-20 15:12:20','e93ea478-1dc1-43cb-961e-27122ed26787'),(2195,2195,1,NULL,'__temp_lczjuokmzbhhbyxyrynxewsouacztdqeogei',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-20 15:12:20','2026-04-20 15:12:20','4773def1-a1e1-42c1-9506-a95279e3d69d'),(2196,2196,1,NULL,'__temp_qrcmkinkbbxnuibhhyluprgddxbrnwukdrjd',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>The Matrix Builder is a flexible content system for structured page layouts — reusable blocks like text, media, galleries, CTAs and sliders, freely combined by editors. Developers keep full control over clean, semantic markup and a consistent design system.</p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"🧱 What Is the Matrix Builder in Craft CMS?\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:12:20','2026-04-20 15:12:20','4dcb0caa-932f-4fe1-a83f-673189a50037'),(2197,2197,1,'Matrix Builder','matrix-builder','matrix-builder','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Matrix Builder\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"Matrix Builder — Component-Based Page Layouts in Craft CMS — Flexible page layouts with Craft CMS Matrix fields — reusable Twig components, custom CSS Grid, and full editorial control. No code required for editors.\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:12:52','2026-04-20 15:12:52','d02c988c-5c1c-4dd3-9489-c432bf752517'),(2198,2198,1,NULL,'__temp_igexmbvajwvcuuzsdrygzfnvhrvrckpdgpyk',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p>Flexible, component-based page layouts — editors combine blocks like text, images, CTAs and quotes without touching code. Every block is a reusable Twig component, placed into a custom CSS Grid with named areas like content, popout, or full. Editors control structure. Developers control markup.</p>\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:12:52','2026-04-20 15:12:52','1f30d9b5-14af-4d6b-b767-40f2f288800a'),(2201,2201,1,'CKE Builder','cke-builder','cke-builder','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"981facbf-3e2f-4e4b-9f37-d1b8629dd72b\": \"<h1><strong>CKEditor Builder</strong></h1><p>Structured components — images, quotes, buttons, CTAs — inserted directly inside CKEditor, rendered through the same Twig components as the Matrix Builder. Editors write in a familiar WYSIWYG interface and add rich components inline. Developers keep  \\n  full control over markup, consistency, and performance.</p><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2203\\\"> </craft-entry><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2204\\\"> </craft-entry><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2205\\\"> </craft-entry><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2206\\\"> </craft-entry><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2207\\\"> </craft-entry><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2208\\\"> </craft-entry><p> </p>\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"CKEditor Builder — Structured Components Inside Craft CMS Rich Text — Insert reusable components directly inside CKEditor — images, quotes, CTAs and more, rendered through Twig. Structured content and rich text, seamlessly combined in Craft CMS.\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:15:05','2026-04-20 15:15:05','83abb30a-0cc9-4c11-998b-c5e49aeac593'),(2202,2202,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"CKEditor Builder — Structured Components Inside Craft CMS Rich Text\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Insert reusable components directly inside CKEditor — images, quotes, CTAs and more, rendered through Twig. Structured content and rich text, seamlessly combined in Craft CMS.\", \"fb364fbf-e22b-4dbe-8570-724df7c5e068\": [487]}',1,'2026-04-20 15:15:05','2026-04-20 15:15:05','39052fc9-ac2a-4390-852f-4d2c1f6e4ade'),(2203,2203,1,NULL,'__temp_vgccdvbdefwezefmckhnaqopreqdtocgmzvk',NULL,'{\"26b82635-94fe-4602-bc9b-85d9440f803d\": false, \"293325f0-efb5-4532-bed8-8ece59244dd0\": [487]}',1,'2026-04-20 15:15:05','2026-04-20 15:15:05','c09f237d-16c2-4dd6-bc04-1df789a8ac2d'),(2204,2204,1,NULL,'__temp_nzwqilhprefitoykdnndmnkqygbsdbwgxmlx',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-20 15:15:05','2026-04-20 15:15:05','08f58aca-fb4c-4cf5-9019-634ef2d2388d'),(2205,2205,1,NULL,'__temp_igbljwmkmxvycgserlgkiqwjofuiskhrquip',NULL,'{\"b8d6efb4-2958-4af8-bc7d-70882b9d2432\": [1196, 1111, 43, 42, 41, 28]}',1,'2026-04-20 15:15:05','2026-04-20 15:15:05','18516a09-a82b-4737-ab6a-c857cbff7bb8'),(2206,2206,1,NULL,'__temp_iqpgdauuffllytjcwyogrxgxhycfvsvfeply',NULL,'{\"0f59f188-6699-4347-a393-7cc6ddd680fc\": true, \"61e6d6af-7f1b-4d26-aee8-03abb530b6eb\": \"Cards\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:15:05','2026-04-20 15:15:05','23c91316-4615-455c-981d-5d0e835d13a3'),(2207,2207,1,NULL,'__temp_chcdsoceehskmeaejhnlktaqyzrhotbhartq',NULL,'{\"d04bc466-1b82-4e88-ba5a-d772666f5e29\": \"Features\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:15:05','2026-04-20 15:15:05','f4411e39-d5a8-4cca-aec9-3c55bf9dd609'),(2208,2208,1,NULL,'__temp_zojzcdnnmrsxlibrfgrfzbifpkvvfgewdfqh',NULL,'{\"1d7830ee-7479-40b2-96b0-17200bd14633\": \"Use these components in your own project!\", \"8731b252-877d-4cfa-80b2-c380c4af26be\": {\"type\": \"url\", \"label\": \"👉 Download Craft Kit\", \"value\": \"https://github.com/handplant/craftcms-lazy-starter-kit\"}}',1,'2026-04-20 15:15:05','2026-04-20 15:15:05','597422fe-cdb0-4f07-ba1c-b883f14de048'),(2211,2211,1,'Map','datastar-map','map','{\"0c03aeb7-3181-4eb2-93bf-4bba1f224c26\": \"Interactive Maps in Craft CMS — Datastar & Leaflet Demo — Dynamic markers, category filters, and clustering — powered by Craft CMS, Leaflet, and Datastar. A hypermedia-driven map built entirely in Twig, with the server as the single source of truth\", \"2b51574c-5057-4c70-9a63-3e3612eb11b0\": \"<h1><strong>Interactive Maps in Craft CMS — Datastar &amp; Leaflet Demo</strong></h1><p>Interactive, data-driven maps in Craft CMS — dynamic markers, category filters, and clustering, all rendered in Twig. Leaflet handles the map, Datastar manages reactivity over SSE. No JavaScript framework, no page reloads, no client-side state. Just  \\n  fast, server-rendered geodata — perfect for directories, location listings, or event maps.</p>\", \"9c489dde-d3e4-48c2-835e-1cd576c86441\": 0}',1,'2026-04-20 15:16:10','2026-04-20 15:16:10','bd81dc96-8a86-4b0e-bc26-c9e7fecfce74'),(2212,2212,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Interactive Maps in Craft CMS — Datastar & Leaflet Demo\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Dynamic markers, category filters, and clustering — powered by Craft CMS, Leaflet, and Datastar. A hypermedia-driven map built entirely in Twig, with the server as the single source of truth\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:16:10','2026-04-20 15:16:10','13cfa480-5d88-4f89-8064-2e7cfce73431'),(2215,2215,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Craft Kit —\\nThe Craft CMS Starter Kit Agencies Build On\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"Craft Kit — Craft CMS Starter Kit with Datastar & Hypermedia — A production-ready Craft CMS 5 boilerplate — Vite, Tailwind, Datastar and DDEV preconfigured. Hypermedia-first, server-rendered, no JavaScript frameworks.\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:19:05','2026-04-20 15:19:05','ba4b9910-868d-487d-be1a-0bd4a6fd2d08'),(2216,2216,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Craft Kit — Craft CMS Starter Kit with Datastar & Hypermedia\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"A production-ready Craft CMS 5 boilerplate — Vite, Tailwind, Datastar and DDEV preconfigured. Hypermedia-first, server-rendered, no JavaScript frameworks.\", \"fb364fbf-e22b-4dbe-8570-724df7c5e068\": [700]}',1,'2026-04-20 15:19:05','2026-04-20 15:19:05','5d20388d-7f40-46d3-8518-c3904e801cd2'),(2219,2219,1,'Home','home','__home__','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Craft Kit —\\nThe Craft CMS Starter Kit Agencies Build On\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"Craft CMS Starter Kit with Datastar & Hypermedia — A production-ready Craft CMS 5 boilerplate — Vite, Tailwind, Datastar and DDEV preconfigured. Hypermedia-first, server-rendered, no JavaScript frameworks.\"}',1,'2026-04-20 15:53:51','2026-04-20 15:53:51','aaf8ed65-59e6-45aa-86ba-25f713f0d92e'),(2220,2220,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Craft CMS Starter Kit with Datastar & Hypermedia\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"A production-ready Craft CMS 5 boilerplate — Vite, Tailwind, Datastar and DDEV preconfigured. Hypermedia-first, server-rendered, no JavaScript frameworks.\", \"fb364fbf-e22b-4dbe-8570-724df7c5e068\": [700]}',1,'2026-04-20 15:53:51','2026-04-20 15:53:51','5d08896e-e448-4715-b739-354bebfb1599'),(2221,2221,1,'Why Craft Kit','why-craft-kit','why-craft-kit','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"Why Craft Kit?\"}',1,'2026-04-24 07:33:19','2026-11-13 13:39:29','9a780e5f-4e3a-420e-a509-d68747e5b309'),(2222,2222,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"9bd2388d-d293-4f1b-8283-61a80c29e4ac\": \"Why Craft Kit? A Practical Craft CMS Starter Kit\", \"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false, \"f9112d3e-b4f8-4c57-bbba-1c369f98698d\": \"Explore the approach behind Craft Kit: server-rendered Twig, Datastar interactions, reusable content blocks and a configured Craft CMS 5 development setup.\", \"fb364fbf-e22b-4dbe-8570-724df7c5e068\": []}',1,'2026-04-24 07:33:19','2026-11-13 13:39:29','e2acca1b-01ac-425c-8c6c-bb6b6d6253a4'),(2223,2223,1,NULL,'__temp_gyydugypgvjiequfbxcuomsbyqstomnyqdeo',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<h2>Server-rendered by default</h2><p>Craft manages the content, Twig renders the pages, and Datastar updates the parts that need to react. Search results, filtered listings and small interactions stay close to the templates instead of moving into a separate frontend application.</p><p>Use HTML and CSS for the basics, then add the tools an interaction actually needs. The map uses Leaflet, the slider uses Embla, and Datastar connects reactive interfaces to server-rendered HTML.</p>\"}',1,'2026-04-24 07:39:21','2026-11-13 13:39:29','1a4a8588-6bf6-4508-b3d5-2299671083f2'),(2224,2224,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-24 07:39:21','2026-04-24 07:39:21','ea015e80-eaac-4e26-8152-98707d2838d6'),(2225,2225,1,NULL,'__temp_ogfmicazzrcvnwsvebyxikijyjumwqysoinb',NULL,'{\"b9f533b6-e068-4a04-b306-aa4b4be09fcc\": \"Lighthouse scores\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:38:10','2026-04-24 09:03:19','279333e5-e153-40db-a154-8a03de388c94'),(2226,2226,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-24 08:38:10','2026-04-24 08:38:10','02e1270d-c551-4aa2-bc7d-e5a822472d41'),(2227,2227,1,NULL,'__temp_ztqinuafugaiefagibhelbouhaikdypbezce',NULL,'{\"836f8dba-ddc5-4a16-9c55-6d2bee8a454b\": \"Performance\", \"f94d7892-85cd-4710-9458-110b796870ec\": \"100\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:39:06','2026-04-24 08:39:15','e2fe6e52-a197-4618-9479-4195f617df9c'),(2228,2228,1,NULL,'__temp_isvgsreunhrdgvqbxqtvbofznrxkqtlrklxw',NULL,'{\"836f8dba-ddc5-4a16-9c55-6d2bee8a454b\": \"Accessibility\", \"f94d7892-85cd-4710-9458-110b796870ec\": \"100\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:39:18','2026-04-24 08:39:25','922a0451-958e-4429-a252-94cb695555d9'),(2229,2229,1,NULL,'__temp_tvrbbpeacwvdqyuiuxmxldffvwccjbyedytu',NULL,'{\"836f8dba-ddc5-4a16-9c55-6d2bee8a454b\": \"Best practices\", \"f94d7892-85cd-4710-9458-110b796870ec\": \"100\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:39:27','2026-04-24 08:39:35','13f4da83-58b5-4a35-8d40-c976755ac9f0'),(2230,2230,1,NULL,'__temp_fpfcjpohxbsvsjosfjrrngehqsmmbgoosaop',NULL,'{\"836f8dba-ddc5-4a16-9c55-6d2bee8a454b\": \"SEO\", \"f94d7892-85cd-4710-9458-110b796870ec\": \"100\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:39:37','2026-04-24 08:39:45','537fc8c2-1737-4b51-aaaf-352d50ac5461'),(2231,2231,1,NULL,'__temp_qyczkdevkhsquglcuaumrjenkyenhcmoklto',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<h2>What is already configured</h2><ul><li><strong>Craft CMS 5 and Twig</strong> for content modeling and page templates.</li><li><strong>Datastar</strong> for reactive updates with HTML over server-sent events.</li><li><strong>Tailwind CSS and Vite</strong> for styling, development and asset builds.</li><li><strong>DDEV</strong> for a repeatable local development environment.</li><li><strong>SEOMate and LLM Ready</strong> for metadata, sitemaps and Markdown versions of entry pages.</li></ul>\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:40:22','2026-11-13 13:39:29','4502c515-9eb2-474e-bb20-06887e98b2fe'),(2232,2232,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-24 08:40:22','2026-04-24 08:40:22','bf400dbc-6d19-40b7-adfd-b634f8c1c562'),(2233,2233,1,'Why Craft Kit','the-craft-cms-starter-kit-agencies-actually-need','the-craft-cms-starter-kit-agencies-actually-need','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"The Craft CMS Starter Kit Agencies Actually Need\", \"981facbf-3e2f-4e4b-9f37-d1b8629dd72b\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">No headless. No JavaScript framework. Just a clean, fast, production-ready foundation.</p>\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"The Craft CMS Starter Kit Agencies Actually Need\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','73faef0c-6bce-46f1-a433-4879ad5ef1d2'),(2234,2234,1,NULL,'__temp_gyydugypgvjiequfbxcuomsbyqstomnyqdeo',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p>Most agency stacks are overbuilt. A React frontend talking to a headless CMS through a GraphQL API — deployed across three services, maintained by a team of specialists, and introduced to a client who just wants to update a text block.</p><p>Craft Kit is the alternative. A single, opinionated starter kit for Craft CMS 5 that ships with everything a modern project needs and nothing it doesn\'t.</p><blockquote><p>Craft Kit is a scaffold, not a theme. It gives you a structured starting point with established patterns and sane defaults — then gets out of the way. Every part of it is meant to be adapted, extended, or replaced to fit the project at hand.</p></blockquote><h2>Why Craft CMS?</h2><p>Craft is one of the few CMS platforms that gets content modeling right. Fields, sections, entry types, Matrix blocks — the authoring experience is flexible enough for complex projects and simple enough that clients actually use it without training. It doesn\'t force a data structure on you. You build exactly what the project needs.</p><p>And the platform is moving in the right direction. Craft 6, due in late 2026, is being built as a Laravel package — meaning it can be dropped into any existing Laravel application and treated as a first-class dependency. The full Laravel ecosystem becomes available: packages, middleware, tooling, and a talent pool that\'s orders of magnitude larger than any niche PHP framework. For agencies evaluating long-term platform risk, that matters.</p><p>Craft 5 is now an LTS release, with five years of support guaranteed after Craft 6 ships. There is no pressure to migrate before you\'re ready.</p><h2>Why not headless?</h2><p>Headless architecture makes sense for a specific set of problems: native mobile apps consuming the same API, highly distributed content teams, microsecond performance SLAs at massive scale. For most agency projects, it introduces complexity without solving anything the client actually asked for.</p><p>The Hypermedia approach — server-rendered HTML, enriched where needed with lightweight interactivity — delivers the same results with a fraction of the moving parts. Craft CMS handles content modeling and rendering. Twig handles templating. Datastar handles the reactive bits. That\'s the whole stack.</p><blockquote><p>Same UX. Faster development. Fewer dependencies. Easier onboarding for the next developer on the project.</p></blockquote><h2>Lighthouse scores</h2><p>The demo site runs 100 across the board — not as a benchmark exercise, but as a direct consequence of the architecture. Server-rendered HTML is fast. Semantic markup is accessible. Clean output is indexable.</p>\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','45021d1e-51a0-4ea3-b274-f2b6cbe20ed0'),(2235,2235,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','9fd6fc06-9fc7-4d89-a277-9d4095af0f72'),(2236,2236,1,NULL,'__temp_ogfmicazzrcvnwsvebyxikijyjumwqysoinb',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','76422761-5ee0-4f02-bc74-a9a8ca46564c'),(2237,2237,1,NULL,'__temp_ztqinuafugaiefagibhelbouhaikdypbezce',NULL,'{\"836f8dba-ddc5-4a16-9c55-6d2bee8a454b\": \"Performance\", \"f94d7892-85cd-4710-9458-110b796870ec\": \"100\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','8f743959-0835-41c9-b313-f459a61c3626'),(2238,2238,1,NULL,'__temp_isvgsreunhrdgvqbxqtvbofznrxkqtlrklxw',NULL,'{\"836f8dba-ddc5-4a16-9c55-6d2bee8a454b\": \"Accessibility\", \"f94d7892-85cd-4710-9458-110b796870ec\": \"100\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','9ae1ab31-2a56-4659-b8c9-3147a1caba6d'),(2239,2239,1,NULL,'__temp_tvrbbpeacwvdqyuiuxmxldffvwccjbyedytu',NULL,'{\"836f8dba-ddc5-4a16-9c55-6d2bee8a454b\": \"Best practices\", \"f94d7892-85cd-4710-9458-110b796870ec\": \"100\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','d41d283e-7cfa-4f0f-9f45-37c110a99427'),(2240,2240,1,NULL,'__temp_fpfcjpohxbsvsjosfjrrngehqsmmbgoosaop',NULL,'{\"836f8dba-ddc5-4a16-9c55-6d2bee8a454b\": \"SEO\", \"f94d7892-85cd-4710-9458-110b796870ec\": \"100\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','41924157-7bf5-44f3-ad67-87bac92222f1'),(2241,2241,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','c2396baa-8bde-4ee4-81a6-d8b2a387999c'),(2242,2242,1,NULL,'__temp_qyczkdevkhsquglcuaumrjenkyenhcmoklto',NULL,'{\"54ea783f-26e8-4a98-a119-9a041012aa68\": \"<p>These scores hold without any special optimization pass. They are the baseline, not the goal.</p><h2>The stack</h2><p><strong>Craft CMS 5, Twig, Datastar, Vite, Tailwind CSS, DDEV, SEOMate</strong><br /><strong>— and nothing else.</strong></p><p>Every tool has a reason to be here. DDEV ensures every developer on the team gets the same local environment on day one. Vite handles asset bundling with instant HMR. SEOMate covers Open Graph, meta, and sitemaps without configuration overhead. Datastar replaces the need for a JavaScript framework wherever reactivity is required.</p><p>What is not in the stack is just as deliberate: no React, no Vue, no Next.js, no GraphQL, no separate API layer.</p>\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','98f48b4b-3e85-4374-8e84-d324c222c7d7'),(2243,2243,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','6f0ef6ef-26d0-4ed8-a308-0b3f585ea11e'),(2244,2244,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"e3b0b587-97fc-47a0-a491-7e55f71b27ad\": false}',1,'2026-04-24 08:46:57','2026-04-24 08:46:57','ac009e25-e0a4-4a1c-9822-3667233fd314'),(2245,2245,1,'Why Craft Kit','the-craft-cms-starter-kit-agencies-actually-need','the-craft-cms-starter-kit-agencies-actually-need','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"The Craft CMS Starter Kit Agencies Actually Need\", \"981facbf-3e2f-4e4b-9f37-d1b8629dd72b\": \"<p class=\\\"ui-teaser\\\">No headless. No JavaScript framework. Just a clean, fast, production-ready foundation.</p>\", \"c0b7cbea-b2bc-4f4c-88f4-8117f3000cb9\": \"The Craft CMS Starter Kit Agencies Actually Need\"}',1,'2026-04-24 08:47:08','2026-04-24 08:47:08','2f45393e-6bdb-4bf8-a363-aaac2edf7d9c'),(2246,2246,1,'Why Craft Kit','the-craft-cms-starter-kit-agencies-actually-need','the-craft-cms-starter-kit-agencies-actually-need','{\"1a9a9160-4064-4d41-b55f-e820ab14f99c\": 0, \"872f39e9-c6e7-4db6-9915-33944177d829\": \"The Craft CMS Starter Ki