ry data-entry-id=\\\"2659\\\"> </craft-entry><p>Supporting details can stay close to the paragraph they explain. Open an item to see what changes between the two rendering contexts.</p><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2661\\\"> </craft-entry><p>A small set of related examples can follow the text without introducing another page container.</p><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2665\\\"> </craft-entry><craft-entry data-entry-id=\\\"2669\\\"> </craft-entry>\"}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','9486c51d-6ad2-4717-800a-53b32f236492'),(2656,2656,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"2865337a-17be-4f7e-abb6-f993a4223470\": \"ckeditor\"}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','cd1c9b5e-1608-475a-be1e-d0d9a1fbb4de'),(2657,2657,1,NULL,'__temp_vgccdvbdefwezefmckhnaqopreqdtocgmzvk',NULL,'{\"26b82635-94fe-4602-bc9b-85d9440f803d\": false, \"293325f0-efb5-4532-bed8-8ece59244dd0\": [487]}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','3c67348f-27d9-4e35-9070-f28b4e38b4e0'),(2658,2658,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','ddf46248-00a6-4f44-a4e0-5948176ac12f'),(2659,2659,1,NULL,'__temp_igbljwmkmxvycgserlgkiqwjofuiskhrquip',NULL,'{\"26b82635-94fe-4602-bc9b-85d9440f803d\": true, \"293325f0-efb5-4532-bed8-8ece59244dd0\": [2526]}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','90ca0a20-4251-4a71-b6ab-b47f7a3129ba'),(2660,2660,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','8d4e5806-8786-4314-9ac3-ad88d784cd05'),(2661,2661,1,NULL,'__temp_nzwqilhprefitoykdnndmnkqygbsdbwgxmlx',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','fd8ed384-1d11-4c87-9007-c5256dc6572d'),(2662,2662,1,NULL,'__temp_xjgdvegodljmwlkksbqeiwwutbmnpsizxqjn',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>The block is part of the rich-text flow rather than a separate full-width section. It uses the inline wrapper and inherits the existing content width.</p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"What changes inside CKEditor?\"}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','152d48ab-1836-40e2-a792-62288a1c61af'),(2663,2663,1,NULL,'__temp_gtgqhtedokfasrmhfbzkjfczvkqzrvmvlqdc',NULL,'{\"1914e261-c0f4-4bd8-ba28-a8d24eb68efc\": false, \"2f81e9a4-b86d-4811-acbc-2c63e797e15b\": \"<p>No. Matrix and CKEditor use the same block templates. The rendering context selects the wrapper, spacing and container behavior.</p>\", \"f5b31de1-27bd-4d5b-b4f2-d55ac6415806\": \"Are these different components?\"}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','155025cd-7faf-4293-bb39-59be237d961c'),(2664,2664,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','c1df6009-faf5-43c3-aeae-87f3f72e8032'),(2665,2665,1,NULL,'__temp_iqpgdauuffllytjcwyogrxgxhycfvsvfeply',NULL,'{\"0f59f188-6699-4347-a393-7cc6ddd680fc\": true}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','73c94330-b582-433a-84ea-febd915ed76c'),(2666,2666,1,NULL,'__temp_pbzryrumbosbqslgmnqmgflrfkcobucaikfb',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Datastar Blog\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:258@1:url}\"}, \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Try category filtering and load more posts without a full page reload.</p>\"}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','ec040a12-fc63-4153-b289-a3099f3cff34'),(2667,2667,1,NULL,'__temp_veomzaivenqpbvzvohuazruhkqifopiqmncz',NULL,'{\"4ca0b060-ab25-4210-ba7a-04339db07b5d\": \"Datastar Map\", \"b68b894d-8c8e-4fc8-af1c-45b45dfc82d5\": {\"type\": \"entry\", \"label\": \"Read more\", \"value\": \"{entry:1029@1:url}\"}, \"e3da269c-60c2-4d60-9a98-718ef293562c\": \"<p>Explore locations with filters, map markers and clustering.</p>\"}',1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','93c1d4af-a0da-4096-9d38-16c90569004c'),(2668,2668,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-11-13 15:11:28','2026-11-13 15:11:28','48a13331-9324-49a2-a6c1-4ec5f044cf05'),(2669,2669,1,NULL,'__temp_zojzcdnnmrsxlibrfgr